<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets mark warrants on 3-month Libor.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets mark warrants on 3-month Libor.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued a total of one million EARN (Expected to Accrue Return on Nominal) style warrants, on the three-month mark Libor rate, lead manager Bankers Trust International, Frankfurt said.</p>
<p> UPPER RANGE     2.95-3.50 PCT	   MAX RETURN   270.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.85 DEM		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.SEP.96		 PAYDATE	30.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   BER FFT DDF HAM MUN STG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3.125 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
